abstract: >-
  A static CesiumJS globe (keyless: no Cesium ion, no API keys) that plots sourced UAP and other high-strangeness
  cases against military, nuclear, conflict, water, sky and ancient-site reference layers, with an 8000 BCE to
  present timeline, dossiers that state the source, evidence grade and coordinate source of every point, a link
  graph, convergence hotspots, a hypothesis-testing panel with explicit, seeded baselines, generated reports and a
  full audit trail. Rows are plotted only when sourced; imprecise locations are drawn as uncertainty circles and
  never jittered. Methodology, limitations and a data dictionary are in docs/.
